v 3
d rfixest: fast fixed-effects regressions in Stata, estimated by the R package fixest
d
d Linear, Poisson and negative binomial regressions with many high-dimensional
d fixed effects, several outcomes at once, robust and multiway clustered
d standard errors. Results come back to Stata as a regular estimation command.
d Requires R (any recent version). Type "rfixest setup" once after installing.
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261104
